        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "less and less",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C60F101AEA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 69,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "We know what we need to do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BDD5ABFAA1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "How do we do it?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "79119F5EDF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "And that's what I'm here to teach you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F3A08D2718",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "Your savings behavior isn't a question of how smart you are or how much willpower you have.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8479478C02",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "The amount we save depends on the environmental cues around us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C9D02EBD57",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "Let me give you an example.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DC90C745D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "We ran a study in which, in one group, we showed people their income on a monthly basis.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C1BD40BDE7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "In another group, we showed people their income on a weekly basis.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18BD332B92",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "And what we found was that people who saw their income on a weekly basis were able to budget better throughout the month.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FEF027D466",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 158,
        "text": "Now, it's important to know that we didn't change how much money people were receiving, we just changed the environment in which they understood their income.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5773B6268F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "And environmental cues like this have an impact.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5F642D15F9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "So I'm not going to share tricks with you that you already know.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0D5639B801",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "I'm not going to tell you how to open up a savings account or how to start saving for your retirement.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E0B58CCA45",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "What I am going to share with you is how to bridge this gap from your intentions to save and your actions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2A6012C0D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "Are you ready?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "13CABFA5D5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "Here's number one: harness the power of pre-commitment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AD503C42C6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "Fundamentally, we think about ourselves in two different ways: our present self and our future self.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FBEDC23DB5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "In the future, we're perfect.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2CC9CD4382",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 15,
        "endOffset": 116,
        "text": "we're going to save for retirement, we're going to lose weight, we're going to call our parents more.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6FA43C54B7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "But we oftentimes forget that our future self is exactly the same person as our present self.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B62580DCBA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "when you get your tax return",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "781E5E5ADE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "So we tried an A/B test.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "198B2015A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "In the first group, we texted people in early February, hopefully before they even filed for their taxes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A6C3105030",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "If you get a tax refund, what percentage would you like to save?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "574BF7DCDE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "Now this is a really hard question.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2DF622202B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "They didn't know if they would receive a tax refund or how much.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6BC2986AF1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "But we asked the question anyway.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8863997D66",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 78,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "What percentage would you like to save?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0EEC3C2097",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "Now, here's what happened.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9332621257",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "In that second condition, when people just received their tax refund, they wanted to save about 17 percent of their tax refund.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "802AD4F345",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 92,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "increased from 17 percent to 27 percent",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E12D91513D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 4,
        "text": "Why?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "89AC32BBC4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "you're committing for your future self",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "419150C4A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "future self",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F5418E6AD3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "These large changes in savings behavior came from the fact that we changed the decision-making environment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "42A3B8CD6E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "you to be able to harness that same power",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A320678748",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "think about the ways in which you can sign up your future self",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1744681DDB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "future self",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "622C9A59DC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "Sign up for an app that lets you make savings decisions in advance.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6D1D03AC70",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "The trick is, you have to have that binding contract.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5ABFD0A0DA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "Number two: use transition moments to your advantage.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C1E3C73150",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "We did an experiment with a website that helps older adults share their housing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "54A6F7252A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "We ran two ads on social media, targeted to the same population of 64-year-olds.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "25329C37CE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 24,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "Hey, you're getting older.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E1F4837715",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "Are you ready for retirement?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AED1F871AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "House sharing can help.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "58AE247AD6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 66,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "You're 64 turning 65",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "212D444C4B",
