      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "Whether it's the start of a new year or even a new season, your motivation to act increases.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "43342C6917",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "So right now, put a meeting request on your calendar for the day before your next birthday.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AB47AD650E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "Identify the one financial thing you most want to do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "86C3C5E306",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "And commit yourself to it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B547C5B892",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "The third and final trick: get a handle on small, frequent purchases.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "00CE662728",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 128,
        "text": "We've run a few different studies and found that the number one purchase people say they regret, after bank fees, is eating out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3BC2CF2B52",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 60,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "death by a thousand cuts",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A056C525B4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "It's a frequent purchase we make almost every day, and it's death by a thousand cuts.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4FCD5CF6A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "A coffee here, a burrito there ...",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "755AA0C4D7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "It adds up and decreases our ability to save.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4BAA630BF5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "Back when I lived in New York City, I looked at my expenses and saw that I spent over 2,000 dollars on ride-sharing apps.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EF6CC18897",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "It was more than my New York City rent.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "27F21A4F4B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "I vowed to make a change.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "89398238E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "And the next month, I spent 2,000 dollars again -- no change, because the information alone didn't change my behavior.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5B8E5FA422",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "I didn't change my environment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2ABDA2DF3A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "So now that I was 4,000 dollars in the hole, I did two things.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A0949E2A90",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "The first is that I unlinked my credit card from my car-sharing apps.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6A0ECB7AA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "Instead, I linked a debit card that only had 300 dollars a month.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "067BF40A51",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 144,
        "text": "If I needed more, I had to go through the whole process of adding a new card, and we know that every click, every barrier, changes our behavior.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5C7E286FCF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "We aren't machines.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "43CE9D5F3E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "We don't carry around an abacus every day, adding up what we're spending, in comparison to what we wanted.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CDD28B535D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "But what our brains are very good at is counting up the number of times we've done something.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FE4872D63C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "So I gave myself a limit.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7F9E82734C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "I can only use ride-sharing apps three times a week.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E5A8A977AA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "It forced me to ration my travels.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5C5211371F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 2,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "got a handle on",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5599C4FEF7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "I got a handle on my car-sharing expenses to the benefit of my husband, because of the environmental changes that I did.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9B60BED5A0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 45,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "for you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "95F8EB3373",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 3,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "get a handle on",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D3BE096109",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "So get a handle on whatever that purchase is for you, and change your environment to make it harder to do so.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "091F716B81",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 18,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "for you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "83966D4398",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "Those are my tips for you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0FB93BAFD0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "879F848401",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "But I want you to remember one thing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "25A63F1FD2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "As human beings, we can be irrational when it comes to saving and spending and budgeting.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D3D8450F90",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "But luckily, we know this about ourselves, and we can predict how we'll act under certain environments.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8AEDE9530E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "Let's do that with saving.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68F28149B4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "Let's change our environment to help our future selves.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ADEAA23E91",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
